TERRA, a machine of model27 (tools/machines/terra/): written anew in fixed point after Mutable Instruments Plaits
by Emilie Gillet (https://github.com/pichenettes/eurorack, commit 08460a6): its WaveTerrainEngine
(plaits/dsp/engine2/wave_terrain_engine.cc: the five terrain formulas, the path, the AUX output) and its
FastSineOscillator (plaits/dsp/oscillator/sine_oscillator.h, the quadrature "magic circle"); no line of its C++ is
copied as is. Its wavetable data wav_integrated_waves (plaits/resources.cc, banks 0 to 2) are copied as they are into
tools/machines/terra/terra_tables.h by tools/gen_terra.py: TERRA's terrains 6 to 8 read them.
